s,t,m\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f4bf86f66c1444da\" href=\"?note=f4bf86f66c1444da\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md\">../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"97fc176afb39ca42\" href=\"?note=97fc176afb39ca42\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11MeetOfNodes}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11MeetOfNodes}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}meet\\text{-}of\\text{-}nodes}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11MeetOfNodes}_S(m,s,t,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\land\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,D)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(m,n,D)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S(m,s,t,n)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}meet\\text{-}of\\text{-}nodes}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11MeetOfNodes}_S(m,s,t,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinSeq}(s,D)\\land\\mathrm{FinSeq}(t,D)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(m,n,D)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree11CommonInitialSegment}_S(m,s,t,n)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The meet is the maximal common initial segment, not merely an arbitrary common prefix.  Its length is witnessed by the actual finite domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, avoiding an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}\">\\(\\operatorname{lh}\\)</span> operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment.md","status":"resolved","id":"97fc176afb39ca42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-tree11-common-initial-segment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"f4bf86f66c1444da","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinSeq}\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-finite-sequence.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","